# Harness sessions and traces.
.little-harness/

# Workflow event stores. These do NOT land under `.little-harness/`: the harness hands a
# workflow `persistence.dataDir = "<sessionId>/workflows"` (a RELATIVE path — see
# packages/little-harness/src/execution/turn-tools.ts) and `localWorld` resolves it against
# `process.cwd()`, so an inline workflow spills its sqlite store next to wherever the
# process was started. The dreamer's sessions are named `dream-<slug>-<timestamp>`.
/dream-*/
